e to AlFursan members only.</li>\n  <li>Members who purchase during the booking period and travel during the travel period will earn <strong>96% additional Bonus Miles</strong>.</li>\n  <li>flyadeal terms and conditions apply.</li>\n  <li>AlFursan terms and conditions apply.</li>\n  <li>Enjoy greater flexibility with the <strong>flyMax</strong> bundle, including cancellation at any time and other features.</li>\n  <li>More Reward Miles.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}